1
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:05,980
=The Cruel Tribunal=
=Episode 15=

2
00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:08,200
Your Majesty,

3
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:10,560
the matter of naming
the Crown Prince is urgent.

4
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:12,440
Zhou led the troops
against the enemy forces

5
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:13,720
and returned with honor,

6
00:01:14,080 --> 00:01:15,680
earning the people's admiration.

7
00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:18,440
But Zhou is too attached
to matters of the heart.

8
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:21,400
That is a fatal weakness.

9
00:01:21,410 --> 00:01:23,270
Piao, on the other hand,
is becoming more and more like you.

10
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:24,920
I can see his ambition

11
00:01:24,930 --> 00:01:26,430
and the commanding presence of a ruler.

12
00:01:26,440 --> 00:01:28,520
If he could be a little less ruthless

13
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:30,640
and a little more compassionate,

14
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:33,200
he would truly
be a rare and worthy successor.

15
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:36,920
Tell me,

16
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:40,880
what should I do?

17
00:01:41,580 --> 00:01:45,180
(Guaranteed Win Legal House)

18
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,520
Where exactly are you taking me?

19
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:49,800
We're here.

20
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:03,640
Wasn't this place burned down?

21
00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:04,840
You rebuilt it?

22
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:05,960
That's right.

23
00:02:06,160 --> 00:02:07,200
It's a gift for you.

24
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:09,000
Thank you.

25
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:10,800
Guaranteed Win,

26
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,720
I'm back.

27
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,720
Come on.

28
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:21,920
A swing!

29
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:23,480
It's beautiful.

30
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,160
Didn't you say

31
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:26,640
you loved swinging most?

32
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:28,160
And that you liked

33
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,920
having someone push you from behind?

34
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:32,960
Thank you.

35
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:36,040
By the way,

36
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:39,200
I've also written up

37
00:02:39,210 --> 00:02:40,660
the Legal House's fee schedule for you.

38
00:02:43,140 --> 00:02:45,540
(Consultation. Legal Advocate.
Case Filing. Court Representation)

39
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:47,990
I don't need it anymore.

40
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,510
From now on, Guaranteed Win Legal House

41
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:51,280
will only provide legal aid.

42
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:53,550
You don't want to make money anymore?

43
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,280
That's not important.

44
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:56,960
I know everything now.

45
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:59,360
What do you know?

46
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:01,720
About your marriage to Rousang.

47
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,080
How did you find out?

48
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:05,960
Never mind that.

49
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:08,760
Your uncle and I
have already discussed it.

50
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,040
Before long,

51
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:11,200
we'll choose an auspicious day

52
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:12,760
and arrange for you

53
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:14,000
to marry Rousang.

54
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:16,120
That way,

55
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:18,600
our two families will be even closer.

56
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:19,280
Mother,

57
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,160
I cannot.

58
00:03:20,820 --> 00:03:21,920
I've always regarded Rousang

59
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:23,800
as my own younger sister.

60
00:03:24,760 --> 00:03:25,880
Besides,

61
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:27,440
I

62
00:03:27,880 --> 00:03:29,200
already have someone I love.

63
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:32,200
Who is she?

64
00:03:33,160 --> 00:03:34,240
Jiang Xiaobai.

65
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:36,840
(At least you know what to say)

66
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:40,320
My boyfriend is getting married,

67
00:03:40,320 --> 00:03:42,240
and I'm the last one to find out.

68
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:44,000
Xiaobai,

69
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:45,200
it's not like that.

70
00:03:45,210 --> 00:03:46,720
I only found out a few days ago myself.

71
00:03:46,720 --> 00:03:48,240
Her Highness is right.

72
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:49,360
Rousang

73
00:03:49,600 --> 00:03:50,680
is beautiful,

74
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:51,920
gentle,

75
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:54,080
and she's also Prince Luan's niece.

76
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:55,680
She's a true lady from a noble family.

77
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:56,720
Unlike me,

78
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,160
I'm hot-tempered,

79
00:03:58,160 --> 00:03:59,040
difficult,

80
00:03:59,040 --> 00:04:00,270
and I'm always snapping at you.

81
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:00,880
Besides,

82
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:03,320
I'm just some wild girl from nowhere.

83
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,120
Yes.

84
00:04:06,160 --> 00:04:07,120
You're right.

85
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:08,720
Rousang

86
00:04:08,720 --> 00:04:09,840
is gentle and considerate,

87
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:10,920
virtuous and gracious,

88
00:04:11,160 --> 00:04:12,960
and she's Prince Luan's niece.

89
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,640
A true lady from a noble family.

90
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:16,680
Are you asking for trouble?

91
00:04:21,880 --> 00:04:22,760
But

92
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:27,400
you dare to stand before the court,

93
00:04:27,410 --> 00:04:28,890
submit petitions and speak your mind.

94
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:30,880
You stand up for what you believe in

95
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:32,080
and for

96
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:32,840
Qiniang,

97
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:33,840
Yang Dou,

98
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:34,760
He Dang,

99
00:04:35,020 --> 00:04:36,430
and the people of the Eastern Market,

100
00:04:36,440 --> 00:04:37,760
do whatever needs to be done.

101
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:45,320
You're no wild girl.

102
00:04:46,080 --> 00:04:47,160
You're the finest legal advocate

103
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:48,880
in Bojue Kingdom.

104
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,360
And it was your courage

105
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,780
that gave me the courage
to take a step forward

106
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,480
and hold you in my arms.

107
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,040
Our investigation has found

108
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:05,320
that the criminal Lu Cen

109
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:06,720
harbors a vicious heart

110
00:05:06,880 --> 00:05:09,040
and is as vicious as a wild beast.

111
00:05:10,180 --> 00:05:11,680
On multiple occasions in the capital,

112
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:12,720
he wielded deadly weapons

113
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:13,840
and murdered officials of the Bojue

114
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:14,920
imperial court.

115
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:16,280
Such a vicious criminal

116
00:05:16,280 --> 00:05:17,440
has offended Heaven above

117
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:18,720
and defied human morality below.

118
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:20,720
He cannot be tolerated under the law.

119
00:05:20,880 --> 00:05:22,440
(Prisoner)
His crimes have aroused universal outrage.

120
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,360
In accordance with the law,

121
00:05:24,440 --> 00:05:26,880
Lu Cen shall be put to death.

122
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:27,920
Today,

123
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,600
he shall face lawful execution,

124
00:05:29,620 --> 00:05:31,310
and his severed head
shall be displayed in public.

125
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:33,800
This shall serve as
a warning to all evildoers

126
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:35,950
and restore order throughout
the court and realm.

127
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:37,760
Execute him!

128
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:48,760
Why do you

129
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:51,120
look so troubled?

130
00:05:52,900 --> 00:05:53,960
I keep feeling that this case

131
00:05:53,960 --> 00:05:55,240
isn't that simple.

132
00:05:56,090 --> 00:05:57,040
What makes you say that?

133
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:59,200
Back then, so many officials

134
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:01,360
were under heavy protection,

135
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,600
yet they were still killed,

136
00:06:02,660 --> 00:06:04,120
and no one could even
give a clear description

137
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,120
of what he looked like.

138
00:06:05,380 --> 00:06:07,930
Even the portrait on the official
Wanted Notice was only a guess.

139
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,840
That shows how capable he was.

140
00:06:12,100 --> 00:06:13,240
Back during the Imperial Retreat case,

141
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,680
when we were investigating Cheng Gui,

142
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:17,160
even I had no idea where to begin,

143
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:18,480
yet he somehow came after me.

144
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:19,800
That shows

145
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:21,160
how cautious he was

146
00:06:21,200 --> 00:06:22,980
and how skilled
he was at avoiding detection.

147
00:06:23,570 --> 00:06:25,280
A man with exceptional
martial arts skills

148
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:26,560
who could come and go without a trace

149
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:28,520
and was extremely cautious

150
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:30,960
was caught by the authorities so easily.

151
00:06:30,960 --> 00:06:32,440
Don't you find that strange?

152
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:34,640
Jiang Xiaobai,

153
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:36,880
don't tell me you're trying
to reopen Lu Cen's case.

154
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:38,440
This is no small matter.

155
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:39,560
No.

156
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,800
I just feel that this whole matter

157
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:44,080
is being deliberately suppressed.

158
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:45,760
Do you have any leads?

159
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:48,400
No.

160
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:50,160
But

161
00:06:52,080 --> 00:06:54,200
a woman's intuition is rarely wrong.

162
00:06:54,880 --> 00:06:55,640
Then

163
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:57,200
where do you want to start?

164
00:06:57,520 --> 00:06:59,240
We'll pick up
wherever the trail went cold.

165
00:07:01,340 --> 00:07:03,180
(Xichun Pavilion)

166
00:07:04,850 --> 00:07:05,640
You keep watch here.

167
00:07:05,640 --> 00:07:06,530
I'll go meet my contact.

168
00:07:06,540 --> 00:07:07,860
Come on. One, two.

169
00:07:08,310 --> 00:07:08,880
Make it quick.

170
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:09,920
Don't worry.

171
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,200
I've done this before.

172
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,800
Fresh vegetables!

173
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:15,600
Yang Dou.

174
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:16,680
Yang Dou.

175
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:18,520
There's more over there.

176
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,080
Miss Jiang.

177
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:26,280
What brings you here?

178
00:07:26,880 --> 00:07:28,040
I need to ask you something.

179
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:29,200
Go ahead.

180
00:07:29,330 --> 00:07:29,770
Sir.

181
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:31,520
- After Cheng Gui went to Langjing Kingdom,
- Do you have tea?

182
00:07:31,520 --> 00:07:32,750
- did he ever come back?
- Two pots of tea.

183
00:07:32,760 --> 00:07:33,870
- Cheng Gui?
- Coming right up.

184
00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:35,360
What did he do this time?

185
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:39,680
Xichun Pavilion.

186
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:41,160
Do you know the place?

187
00:07:41,960 --> 00:07:43,120
Xichun Pavilion?

188
00:07:43,880 --> 00:07:44,840
Cheng Gui used to

189
00:07:44,880 --> 00:07:46,400
meet people there to discuss business.

190
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:48,520
I think he also had a lover there

191
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:49,880
named Hetao.

192
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:50,720
Hetao?

193
00:07:51,390 --> 00:07:52,360
What does she look like?

194
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:53,840
Well,

195
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:54,960
she's quite attractive,

196
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,040
probably

197
00:07:56,320 --> 00:07:57,800
in her forties.

198
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:02,360
Do you have any boats
going to Langjing soon?

199
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:03,720
Miss Jiang,

200
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:06,060
you're not thinking of going
to Xichun Pavilion, are you?

201
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:07,160
I am.

202
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:09,600
(Xichun Pavilion)
It might not be

203
00:08:09,660 --> 00:08:11,120
very convenient for you to go there.

204
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:13,200
Sir!

205
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:16,520
- Come on!
- Come on!

206
00:08:16,520 --> 00:08:19,280
(Xichun Pavilion)
Come on up, sir!

207
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:21,080
Come on!

208
00:08:21,080 --> 00:08:23,400
Inconvenient.
This is beyond inconvenient.

209
00:08:23,960 --> 00:08:26,160
Don't be shy, my friend.

210
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:28,800
You don't get many chances
in life to let yourself go.

211
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,080
Since we're already here,

212
00:08:30,080 --> 00:08:30,840
seriously?

213
00:08:30,840 --> 00:08:32,680
Come on. It's my treat today.

214
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:34,920
What are you waiting for?

215
00:08:34,920 --> 00:08:37,160
Hurry and greet the young masters.

216
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:39,160
- Greetings, Young Master.
- Greetings, Young Master.

217
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:41,800
Greetings, Young Master.

218
00:08:41,880 --> 00:08:43,080
My name is Guiyuan.

219
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:45,080
I excel at music.

220
00:08:47,160 --> 00:08:48,280
Greetings, Young Master.

221
00:08:48,280 --> 00:08:49,400
I'm Xing'er.

222
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:51,390
I'm very good
at understanding people's hearts,

223
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:52,760
especially

224
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:54,640
a man's heart.

225
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:55,960
Young Master,

226
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,360
my name is Taohua.

227
00:08:57,560 --> 00:08:59,000
Here at Xichun Pavilion,

228
00:08:59,120 --> 00:09:01,160
no one can outdrink me.

229
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:02,880
Greetings, Young Master.

230
00:09:02,880 --> 00:09:04,360
My name is Xueliu.

231
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:06,480
I play the pipa well

232
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:09,120
and am even more skilled
in the art of tea.

233
00:09:10,040 --> 00:09:10,840
Young Master,

234
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:12,240
choose one.

235
00:09:13,040 --> 00:09:14,840
Will you stop fooling around?

236
00:09:19,640 --> 00:09:21,520
Since we're already here,
just take a look.

237
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:22,680
I won't hold it against you.

238
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:25,040
Stop fooling around.
Let's get down to business.

239
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:26,840
What?

240
00:09:27,220 --> 00:09:28,480
You think they're all too young

241
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:29,440
and lack maturity?

242
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,040
Our young master

243
00:09:32,040 --> 00:09:33,160
prefers someone

244
00:09:33,280 --> 00:09:35,440
seasoned by the years,

245
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:36,840
yet

246
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:39,280
still full of charm,

247
00:09:39,280 --> 00:09:40,760
understanding and well-mannered.

248
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:42,520
What matters most isn't looks.

249
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,040
It's how she makes him feel.

250
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:44,920
Understand?

251
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:48,400
Why can't any of you

252
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:50,280
understand what our young master wants?

253
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:52,560
Miss,

254
00:09:53,160 --> 00:09:55,320
someone like you would be perfect.

255
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,000
Me?

256
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:00,560
That's right.

257
00:10:00,760 --> 00:10:02,040
What are you doing?

258
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:06,720
Our most important task today

259
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:08,280
is to take good care
of our young master here.

260
00:10:08,280 --> 00:10:09,360
He has this one preference.

261
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:11,120
He only likes women over forty.

262
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:14,040
Got it.

263
00:10:14,440 --> 00:10:15,160
Don't worry.

264
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,080
As for the price,

265
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:17,880
I'll pay you double.

266
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:18,880
But

267
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:21,160
you'd better find just the right person.

268
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:24,240
Well, if that's what you want,

269
00:10:24,560 --> 00:10:26,560
we actually do have someone like that.

270
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:30,560
But there's only one.

271
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,400
One

272
00:10:32,880 --> 00:10:34,120
is enough.

273
00:10:34,160 --> 00:10:35,480
We'll share.

274
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:38,800
Come.

275
00:10:38,920 --> 00:10:40,160
Young Master,

276
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,680
you have such handsome features.

277
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:43,200
With such looks and bearing,

278
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:45,960
I hardly dare look up at you.

279
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:47,240
Thank you.

280
00:10:50,680 --> 00:10:51,600
Young Master,

281
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:53,840
every move you make

282
00:10:54,040 --> 00:10:55,120
truly

283
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:57,240
radiates noble grace.

284
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:07,440
Please have some tea.

285
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:09,760
Just leave it there.

286
00:11:12,280 --> 00:11:13,680
Before I could even serve the tea,

287
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:16,200
I was already overwhelmed
by your noble presence.

288
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:19,320
Do you know someone

289
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:20,480
named Cheng Gui?

290
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:24,600
Young Master,

291
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:26,160
how strange.

292
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,800
You come to Xichun Pavilion,

293
00:11:28,160 --> 00:11:29,200
and the first thing you do

294
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:32,480
is ask about a man.

295
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:40,360
Today,

296
00:11:40,520 --> 00:11:41,800
I must be terribly out of sorts,

297
00:11:42,280 --> 00:11:43,920
making a fool of myself at every turn

298
00:11:44,040 --> 00:11:45,580
in front of two fine gentlemen like you.

299
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:49,040
It's all right.

300
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:49,600
Come.

301
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:50,080
My friend,

302
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:50,720
sit down.

303
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:53,640
Miss Hetao,

304
00:11:54,400 --> 00:11:56,640
the tattoo on your arm
is quite distinctive.

305
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:58,280
Where did you get it?

306
00:11:58,360 --> 00:12:00,760
Maybe I'll have my wife get one too.

307
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:02,640
Young Master,

308
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:04,000
don't joke.

309
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:05,240
This tattoo

310
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:07,760
is unique to the ladies
of Xichun Pavilion.

311
00:12:07,800 --> 00:12:10,080
You really shouldn't
have your wife get one.

312
00:12:11,760 --> 00:12:12,440
My friend...

313
00:12:15,280 --> 00:12:16,080
This is all yours.

314
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:18,440
My friend.

315
00:12:19,880 --> 00:12:20,880
(What's going on?)

316
00:12:20,880 --> 00:12:22,160
(How strange.)

317
00:12:25,800 --> 00:12:26,600
Cheng Gui.

318
00:12:41,520 --> 00:12:43,320
(No one shares my thoughts.)

319
00:12:44,520 --> 00:12:45,960
(My hidden feelings)

320
00:12:46,480 --> 00:12:47,960
(are mine alone.)

321
00:13:00,060 --> 00:13:01,540
(Prince Luan's Residence)

322
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:07,040
Young Lady,

323
00:13:07,240 --> 00:13:09,120
you must be careful.

324
00:13:10,640 --> 00:13:11,440
Goodbye.

325
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:17,600
My shoe!

326
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:19,480
Quick!

327
00:13:19,490 --> 00:13:20,280
Throw it over here.

328
00:13:27,440 --> 00:13:28,120
Young Lady,

329
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:29,920
I can't climb trees!

330
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:32,440
You're on your own.

331
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:42,120
Please spare some food.

332
00:13:42,920 --> 00:13:44,680
- Please spare some food.
- Buns for sale!

333
00:13:44,800 --> 00:13:45,660
Freshly steamed buns!

334
00:13:45,680 --> 00:13:46,920
Please spare some food!

335
00:13:46,920 --> 00:13:48,440
Please, have mercy!

336
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:52,680
(Jade.)

337
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:54,000
(Someone wealthy.)

338
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,890
I'm sure Xiaobai
doesn't know I'm here to see her.

339
00:13:57,580 --> 00:14:00,860
(Guaranteed Win Legal House)

340
00:14:02,820 --> 00:14:04,790
Candied hawthorn!

341
00:14:06,760 --> 00:14:07,600
Sir.

342
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:08,920
Sir.

343
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,000
Are you all right?

344
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:15,000
I'm starving.

345
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:17,080
I haven't eaten in days.

346
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:18,580
How about this?

347
00:14:18,680 --> 00:14:19,600
Come inside with me.

348
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:21,000
I'll get you something to eat.

349
00:14:29,640 --> 00:14:30,240
Miss,

350
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:32,840
are you here all by yourself?

351
00:14:32,920 --> 00:14:33,360
Yes.

352
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:34,680
Everyone else is out.

353
00:14:47,850 --> 00:14:50,450
♪The candle burns down
to its final glow♪

354
00:14:51,410 --> 00:14:53,810
♪Cold fragrance clings to my hem♪

355
00:14:54,450 --> 00:14:56,210
♪You gently smooth my hair♪

356
00:14:56,210 --> 00:14:59,130
♪Yet your gaze drifts far away♪

357
00:15:01,570 --> 00:15:04,010
♪A hidden blade lies beneath your smile♪

358
00:15:04,370 --> 00:15:07,690
♪You turn away
as if nothing has changed♪

359
00:15:08,290 --> 00:15:09,850
♪Step by step, I walk away♪

360
00:15:10,010 --> 00:15:13,330
♪Each step breaks my heart anew♪

361
00:15:16,090 --> 00:15:18,970
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

362
00:15:19,490 --> 00:15:22,570
♪Why leave me
standing alone in the wind?♪

363
00:15:23,010 --> 00:15:25,610
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

364
00:15:25,610 --> 00:15:29,650
♪Yet all that's left
is warmth upon my fingertips♪

365
00:15:29,890 --> 00:15:32,930
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

366
00:15:33,330 --> 00:15:36,010
♪And write of every meeting
and every parting♪

367
00:15:36,010 --> 00:15:38,730
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

368
00:15:39,010 --> 00:15:41,970
♪I'll only say that once♪

369
00:15:42,450 --> 00:15:44,210
♪I called your name♪

370
00:15:48,810 --> 00:15:51,050
♪The silent stars hang low♪

371
00:15:52,450 --> 00:15:54,650
♪The river keeps flowing east♪

372
00:15:55,890 --> 00:15:57,810
♪I linger in the old tower♪

373
00:15:57,930 --> 00:16:01,570
♪Waiting for you,
though all is now empty♪

374
00:16:02,890 --> 00:16:05,330
♪This life still owes us a bow♪

375
00:16:06,210 --> 00:16:09,010
♪May the next repay us with a dream♪

376
00:16:09,770 --> 00:16:12,010
♪Beyond here lie
endless mountains and rivers♪

377
00:16:12,010 --> 00:16:18,250
♪I dare not turn for one last look♪

378
00:16:18,530 --> 00:16:21,410
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

379
00:16:22,010 --> 00:16:25,490
♪Why bury this heart beneath the frost?♪

380
00:16:25,490 --> 00:16:28,130
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

381
00:16:28,130 --> 00:16:32,410
♪Now only fading warmth
remains in my palm♪

382
00:16:32,410 --> 00:16:35,330
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

383
00:16:35,770 --> 00:16:38,490
♪And paint a winter between your brows♪

384
00:16:38,490 --> 00:16:41,170
♪If we meet again in another life♪

385
00:16:41,490 --> 00:16:44,210
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

386
00:16:44,890 --> 00:16:47,170
♪Was when we first met?♪

387
00:16:48,450 --> 00:16:50,850
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

388
00:16:51,970 --> 00:16:53,730
♪Was when we met for the last time?♪
